{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3a9cdcbdb780b1bbc64cb9d967501d0e4cf76ac23b611f0ee39324517b3b6891", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n可憐は、カフェで接客している姿を撮る予定だが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n原本计划拍摄可怜在咖啡店接待客人的样子，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "4a1e2318702048695da96301b49851fff058b8743acd551612560450ae3a3043", "ja": "い、いらっしゃいませ……なな、何名様ですか……？　\n……あぅ。また、うまく言えなかった……。", "zh": "欢、欢迎光临……请、请问几位……？\n……啊呜。又没能好好说出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d3523919582eba4c6c29794f7787638267708fbe82595f60cf652ec74a3074fa", "ja": "お疲れさま、可憐。\nおお。ウェイトレスの衣装、可愛いじゃないか！", "zh": "辛苦了，可怜。\n哦哦，女服务生的服装很可爱嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "5fb0fd371acae7ee2099130e5628db3b36fe74507d68b4be8022578bd19e2019", "ja": "えっ、かっ、かわいい……ですか？\nそんな……き、急に……あ、あぅ……。", "zh": "诶？可、可爱……吗？\n怎么会……突、突然这样……啊、啊呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a73bfe1ecf483c30bdb7cd0da28bb7d0a21588f285f30e148b46acbdcc8b9fbf", "ja": "ああ、ごめん。緊張させるつもりじゃなかったんだ。\n……えーと、今のは接客の練習か？", "zh": "啊，抱歉。我不是想让你紧张的。\n……呃，刚才是在练习接待客人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "689b783f67c6085f76863ba0c7531ca89e697691906d3298fda489156b8e781b", "ja": "は、はい……。お客さん役のみなさんに……\nご迷惑をおかけしないようにと思って、練習を……。", "zh": "是、是的……我想着不能给扮演客人的大家添麻烦……所以才练习的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "1dc2294f2adc63faf3a1753426e4a34fef72b0ef8bcfca52362b80ae347c1c5d", "ja": "でも、相手がいると思うと、緊張してしまって……。\nうぅ……もうすぐ、撮影はじまっちゃうのに……。", "zh": "可是，一想到有对手在场，就会紧张起来……\n呜……明明马上就要开始拍摄了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b20755f6b7057d01d454c9d416cca5e65c7f2ed920c7cdca75b710bcb6388353", "ja": "なるほど。俺でよければ、練習に付き合うよ。\n実際にいた方が、イメージが掴みやすいだろ？", "zh": "原来如此。要是你不介意的话，我来陪你练习吧。\n有实际对象在的话，也更容易找到感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "3cc3558858d1130d3edd6e75a81034ae1ee16d5a12210d0ae1c19f42b954ffe0", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、お客さん……。\nは、はい……ぜひ、お願いします……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生当客人……\n好、好的……那就拜托您了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "ac09cdb3ca754421043059145f6775c55422c17ef87bb7fc1eeea99e452ee830", "ja": "い、いらっしゃいませ……！\nご注文はお決まりでしょうか？", "zh": "欢、欢迎光临……！\n请问您决定好要点什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6927028acd4f0b2d6a5cadf5a2858c55adfafc7d4c35753a84b6e51fb1ed8e0c", "ja": "あ、はい。このオススメにある……。", "zh": "啊，好的。那个推荐菜单上的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "c657c16b02fa35300b33acabacbd7acda8a4f6224552fcd240f6fd6cc7f2fb73", "ja": "はい、『ふっくらハンバーグドリア』ですね。\nかしこまりました……。ふふっ。", "zh": "好的，是“松软汉堡肉焗饭”对吧。\n明白了……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d91d0c6376b48f0635cc7da699341105643178d91da95a2670aed6ca03313c5c", "ja": "……うん、自然にできてるじゃないか。\n今の感じなら心配なさそうだけど。", "zh": "……嗯，做得挺自然的嘛。\n照现在的感觉来看，应该没什么好担心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "d3b5da3dd10c081eb850ba375fa51634d7271a5f91d1e1fb65b7fc2921233386", "ja": "そ、そうですね……。{$P$}さんが\n相手だと、なぜか緊張しなくて……。", "zh": "是、是啊……面对{$P$}先生，\n不知为什么就不会紧张……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1015_p", "source_sha256": "85cdef25b98b95929455a8ab3d37f4a3c5ec556f689537671a8f18cc55e10453", "ja": "気心の知れた相手だからかな？\nうーん、本番はそうもいかないしな……。", "zh": "因为是知根知底的人吧？\n嗯——正式演出时可就没那么轻松了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "8eb71195494ea64d62b7072849af54ef12b720755290679fb9c314eb3ecfc023", "ja": "は、はい……。共演するみなさんも……初対面で……。\nあれ……もし、初対面じゃなかったら……？", "zh": "是、是的……。一起演出的各位也都是……第一次见面……\n咦……如果不是第一次见面的话……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "6fbcbfa4584c078736c0f3b6693e1b0ea5adb19bb28faae844214240ecedb10d", "ja": "あの……！　い、今からお話してきてもいいですか？\n仲よくなれたら……うまくできそうな気がするんです！", "zh": "那个……！我、我现在去和大家聊聊天，可以吗？\n如果能和大家搞好关系……我觉得应该就能顺利完成了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fedbefd9805ec4d7f6d61b396b2ea9826f95aae0dbfd4a2870705d55510831c3", "ja": "ああ、行っておいで！\nきっと共演者のみなさんも喜んでくれると思う。", "zh": "啊，去吧！\n我想共演的各位一定也会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "2ae772bbca4957e26c751bfc0c1525735640d748c771cd1ed74f7bf021255386", "ja": "はい……！　でも、ま、まずは声をかけなきゃ……。\nよ、よし。勇気を出して……い、行ってきます……！", "zh": "好的……！不过，首、首先得去搭话才行……\n好、好。鼓起勇气……我、我去了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0313_1020_p", "source_sha256": "68b902aea733fda824eedea13db7db6fbb53724b25ba4da3b476beafed63acd5", "ja": "（可憐の気遣いで、いい雰囲気になった気がする。\n本番中も可憐の緊張は和らぎ、素敵な写真が撮れた！）", "zh": "（多亏了可怜的体贴，气氛好像变得不错了。正式拍摄时，可怜也放松了紧张情绪，拍出了很棒的照片！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
